# Line endings are LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every
# platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materialises CRLF
# files, and `npm run format:check` fails on all 136 of them while CI — which
# checks out on Linux — passes. That is the worst shape a gate can have: green
# where nobody is looking and red where everybody is.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.dng binary
*.pdf binary
